  "description": {
   "en": "Fan-made adaptation of the famous animation KJ Saga ! \n\nThis follows the story of a man named KJ. KJ is in a phone call, talking to what seems to be his friend, and then a blue man comes out of nowhere and slaps him in the face, breaking KJ's phone in the process. This man would end up saying \"It's kill KJ day\" to reason his random attack.\n\nWhat's next ? Stay tuned to find out !"
